://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T07:52:24Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T07:52:24Z","body":"If possible, I would like to add a toggle in both the `View` menu and the editor settings. The editor settings would be persistent, while the `View` menu could be temporary (or perhaps also persistent?). I'm not sure if the design intent of the editor allows for this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695761754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695764662","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3695764662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3695764662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cSOS2","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T07:54:17Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T07:54:17Z","body":"I believe the added option in the `View` menu should share the same storage as the one in `editor settings` and be persistent, even if other existing options in `View` are not.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695764662/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695766242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3695766242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3695766242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cSOri","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T07:55:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T07:55:14Z","body":"Probably should be persistent, not sure if it should be in editor settings (global) or project metadata (per project). It still can be linked to the View menu toggle.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695766242/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695774971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3695774971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3695774971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cSQz7","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T08:00:14Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T08:00:54Z","body":"2D snapping and similar options are in project metadata, so this probably should be too:\r\n```c++\r\nEditorSettings::get_singleton()->set_project_metadata(\"2d_editor\", \"resample\", resample);\r\n...\r\nbool resample = EditorSettings::get_singleton()->get_project_metadata(\"2d_editor\", \"resample\", true);\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3695774971/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3696985275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3696985275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3696985275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cW4S7","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T16:33:58Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T16:33:58Z","body":"Can't we just update the size when needed instead of taking in the overhead of constantly running a timer and polling?\r\n\r\nWe already have callbacks for scrolling and resizing, so can't we just set a dirty flag and then update only when needed, but update immediately when it's needed? That way we would waste less CPU and have no latency","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3696985275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3697013304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3697013304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3697013304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cW_I4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T16:46:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T16:46:05Z","body":"> We already have callbacks for scrolling and resizing, so can't we just set a dirty flag and then update only when needed, but update immediately when it's needed?\r\n\r\nIt's on e-short timer only started on zoom change, overhead is nearly zero.\r\n\r\nUpdating it immediate might be laggy if a lot of text and fonts are used, since changing oversampling will re-rasterize all glyphs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3697013304/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3697131882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3697131882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3697131882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cXcFq","user":{"login":"scgm0","id":52148221,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTQ4MjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52148221?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0","html_url":"https://github.com/scgm0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scgm0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-29T17:47:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-29T17:48:21Z","body":"> Can't we just update the size when needed instead of taking in the overhead of constantly running a timer and polling?\r\n\r\nThe debounce call using the Timer node has very low performance overhead; it only briefly times when the zoom level changes and does not continuously poll.\r\n\r\n> We already have callbacks for scrolling and resizing, so can't we just set a dirty flag and then update only when needed, but update immediately when it's needed? That way we would waste less CPU and have no latency\r\n\r\nRegardless, we need to introduce a delay. Users might scroll the mouse wheel multiple times in succession to reach the target zoom level. These actions count as a single adjustment, but there are multiple brief pauses in input, and I can't figure out how to distinguish these pauses from actual scrolling stops.  \r\nIf we update immediately, users might experience stuttering in the display while scrolling the mouse wheel, leading to a poor user experience.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3697131882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3698086296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114200#issuecomment-3698086296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114200","id":3698086296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cbFGY","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-30T02:16:09Z","upda